---

This project targets hardware constraints published by Extropic AI. It is an
independent work: it is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or derived from any
Extropic source code. Extropic's own compiler (`thermalizers`, arXiv:2608.01615)
has no public release, and nothing here is derived from it.

Cited Extropic figures are attributed at their point of use in
`src/tsu/target.py`, which records for every hardware constraint whether the
value is sourced to a published figure or is this project's own assumption.

Third-party dependencies (`thrml`, `extro-torx`, JAX, NumPy) carry their own
licenses and are not redistributed here.
